1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Second Episode
The Daughter of Mephisto

15
00:02:04,501 --> 00:02:06,810
I feel it, this is the moment!

16
00:02:07,781 --> 00:02:10,295
Finally I have found
that girl!

17
00:02:18,581 --> 00:02:20,856
The soldiers have already
collected the taxes!

18
00:02:20,901 --> 00:02:22,892
You won't steal any more money!

19
00:02:23,221 --> 00:02:26,611
- Stop him!
- But who is that knight?

20
00:02:27,901 --> 00:02:29,812
He broke all the sacks!

21
00:02:29,861 --> 00:02:32,534
That damned bastard won't
stop us from collecting the taxes!

22
00:02:39,341 --> 00:02:41,491
I told you that you have
to pay the new taxes.

23
00:02:41,541 --> 00:02:43,293
I don't have a single penny left!

24
00:02:43,341 --> 00:02:45,571
Pay what you have to pay
or you will pay with your life!

25
00:02:45,621 --> 00:02:47,737
Please, have mercy!

26
00:02:48,901 --> 00:02:50,812
So you didn't have any money, huh?

27
00:02:51,261 --> 00:02:53,013
And what is this?

28
00:02:53,141 --> 00:02:55,735
But that's the little bit
I need to live on!

29
00:02:55,781 --> 00:02:57,897
Shut up! And now you want to live too?

30
00:02:58,461 --> 00:03:00,611
Why don't you leave
this poor man alone?

31
00:03:00,661 --> 00:03:03,300
But I have nothing to do with it! I was ordered
to collect the new taxes,

32
00:03:03,341 --> 00:03:05,013
but this man doesn't want to pay!

33
00:03:05,061 --> 00:03:07,052
So you are Duralumin's
men, right?

34
00:03:07,101 --> 00:03:09,296
That's none of your business!
And who do you think you are?

35
00:03:09,501 --> 00:03:11,412
Prince Sapphire!

36
00:03:11,461 --> 00:03:13,417
Kid, are you trying to mock us?

37
00:03:13,461 --> 00:03:15,656
this little fool says he is
Prince Sapphire!

38
00:03:15,701 --> 00:03:18,420
- A Prince without an escort!
- He's just a brat!

39
00:03:18,461 --> 00:03:20,816
- Let's get rid of him quickly.
- If you don't disappear, I'll skewer you!

40
00:03:22,301 --> 00:03:24,531
Idiot! The brat is over there!

41
00:03:28,901 --> 00:03:31,893
But it's not me you're supposed to skewer!
It's that guy over there, you idiot!

42
00:03:33,461 --> 00:03:36,658
There is nothing to laugh about!
It's over for you, brat!

43
00:03:37,741 --> 00:03:40,892
Then come on, bring it on!
I'm not afraid of you at all!

44
00:03:43,021 --> 00:03:46,616
Your choice:
either the taxes or jail!

45
00:04:04,221 --> 00:04:07,770
- Damn, I'm pinned down!
- Nice shot! Now let's finish him!

46
00:04:07,901 --> 00:04:09,619
Good! Leave him to me!

47
00:04:12,541 --> 00:04:15,578
Don't you get it that
the brat is over there?!

48
00:04:30,261 --> 00:04:32,013
I'll tell my father everything!

49
00:04:32,221 --> 00:04:36,055
Come down, Prince! It's time
for you to return to the palace!

50
00:04:36,221 --> 00:04:38,018
But where has he gone?

51
00:04:40,821 --> 00:04:42,539
Come here, Opal!

52
00:04:46,501 --> 00:04:49,618
Hello, Prince! Forgive
the rudeness of my men!

53
00:04:49,661 --> 00:04:51,731
So it really is the Prince!

54
00:04:51,781 --> 00:04:55,012
Make them return the money
they took from the villagers!

55
00:04:55,061 --> 00:04:58,690
Let's split it, Prince, so we can
both have fun with that money.

56
00:04:58,901 --> 00:05:01,096
I don't want that money!
You must return it!

57
00:05:01,141 --> 00:05:03,211
Very well, Prince, I will
do as you command.

58
00:05:03,261 --> 00:05:04,614
Good!

59
00:05:05,101 --> 00:05:07,012
That brat is insolent!

60
00:05:07,061 --> 00:05:09,336
You, blockheads,
continue the tax collection!

61
00:05:09,381 --> 00:05:12,691
Spread the word that the money
is needed by the Prince for a castle!

62
00:05:15,821 --> 00:05:17,300
Hand over the money!

63
00:05:17,341 --> 00:05:19,411
The Prince must
build himself a castle!

64
00:05:26,541 --> 00:05:28,497
And what are you doing, slacker?

65
00:05:28,541 --> 00:05:30,213
Go collect the taxes! Move it!

66
00:05:46,301 --> 00:05:49,179
Hecate, I have finally found
the girl I was looking for!

67
00:05:49,221 --> 00:05:51,689
A girl?! Do you
mean that Prince, dad?

68
00:05:53,421 --> 00:05:55,730
Yes! She is a female,
but with a boy's heart!

69
00:05:55,781 --> 00:05:58,500
It's a mistake that Heaven
makes every 2,000 years.

70
00:05:58,781 --> 00:06:01,420
Oh, poor thing! How
sorry I feel for her!

71
00:06:01,461 --> 00:06:04,021
I am convinced that you would
become an excellent witch...

72
00:06:04,061 --> 00:06:06,370
..if you could exchange
your heart for hers.

73
00:06:06,461 --> 00:06:10,852
Come, infernal winds! Honor
my daughter Hecate, lightning!

74
00:06:11,021 --> 00:06:13,740
Thunder! Wind! Lightning bolts!

75
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:16,689
Stir, scourges of hell!

76
00:06:16,740 --> 00:06:20,495
And you, hurricanes, celebrate
the beauty of my daughter!

77
00:06:25,340 --> 00:06:27,377
Now, Hecate, you
too will try to...

78
00:06:27,420 --> 00:06:30,458
Hecate, where did you
go? Hecate! Where are you?

79
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:45,411
My father would like me to be different
from how I am, you know, little bird?

80
00:06:48,820 --> 00:06:51,574
Hecate! Aren't you ashamed
of keeping flowers in your hair?

81
00:06:51,620 --> 00:06:54,692
...and little birds in your hand? Change
the flowers into something ugly!

82
00:06:54,740 --> 00:06:56,413
Hail Mephisto!

83
00:06:57,140 --> 00:06:59,496
Why did you transform it
on my head?!

84
00:06:59,540 --> 00:07:02,533
- Try with a storm, come on!
- Come, lightning!

85
00:07:05,020 --> 00:07:06,818
Blow, wind!

86
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:09,573
Fall, rain!

87
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:12,896
- Well?!
- I can't do it!

88
00:07:12,940 --> 00:07:15,580
Don't cry, my little witch!
We'll find a remedy!

89
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:17,418
I will have you take
a course in witchcraft,

90
00:07:17,460 --> 00:07:19,338
so you will become an excellent witch!

91
00:07:19,740 --> 00:07:21,493
Hail Mephisto!

92
00:07:37,900 --> 00:07:39,732
Who was it?

93
00:07:39,780 --> 00:07:43,091
Who threw water on me?
Ah, it was you!

94
00:07:43,380 --> 00:07:46,293
I wish I could fly too
in the sky, just like you do.

95
00:07:46,340 --> 00:07:49,014
What do you say? Would you take me
for a little ride?

96
00:07:51,260 --> 00:07:53,252
I'm ready! You can go!

97
00:07:56,380 --> 00:07:58,099
Hey!

98
00:08:05,900 --> 00:08:07,732
Hello, Sapphire!

99
00:08:07,780 --> 00:08:11,171
- Tink! Where are you going?
- I'm having a little fun flying!

100
00:08:11,220 --> 00:08:13,018
Wait, I'm coming too!

101
00:08:13,060 --> 00:08:15,416
No! The strings can't take it!
We would be too heavy!

102
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:18,055
Magnificent!
Fly high!

103
00:08:18,100 --> 00:08:21,491
Even higher! Even
further up, come on!

104
00:08:21,540 --> 00:08:23,657
Higher and higher, friends!

105
00:08:23,700 --> 00:08:26,693
Watch out, Sapphire!
You are too heavy!

106
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:31,409
I must try not to
touch the treetops!

107
00:08:31,460 --> 00:08:35,010
The swans can't make it! Now
you are too close to the ground!

108
00:08:36,900 --> 00:08:40,018
I apologize,
Mr. Bull! I apologize!

109
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:44,491
Help! I'm going to
crash into a house!

110
00:08:48,581 --> 00:08:50,936
Forgive me, I really
wasn't able to avoid it.

111
00:08:50,981 --> 00:08:54,291
We worked day and
night to build this house.

112
00:08:54,341 --> 00:08:56,332
But I thought it was a pigsty!

113
00:08:56,381 --> 00:08:58,337
- Boy, how dare you?!
- How dare you?!

114
00:08:58,381 --> 00:09:01,179
It is not by our choice
that we live in this hut!

115
00:09:01,221 --> 00:09:04,657
Our house was destroyed
by the Grand Duke's henchmen,

116
00:09:04,701 --> 00:09:08,011
so we were forced
to live miserably!

117
00:09:08,061 --> 00:09:11,371
- They did this to you?! - Yes! They
took everything we had!

118
00:09:11,421 --> 00:09:13,810
They told us
that the usual taxes are not enough,

119
00:09:13,861 --> 00:09:15,738
so we have to pay more,

120
00:09:15,781 --> 00:09:18,011
because the Prince
must build himself a castle!

121
00:09:18,061 --> 00:09:22,896
- Prince Sapphire is to blame!
- He is a stupid Prince!

122
00:09:22,941 --> 00:09:25,933
They lied to you! I don't have to
build myself any castle!

123
00:09:25,981 --> 00:09:28,654
- But then you are...!
- Our Prince Sapphire!

124
00:09:28,701 --> 00:09:31,898
- is it really you?!
- I must speak to the Grand Duke!

125
00:09:32,541 --> 00:09:34,418
Where did Sapphire go?

126
00:09:34,461 --> 00:09:38,010
Well, I have the impression that Mephisto
is lurking right around here.

127
00:09:38,061 --> 00:09:40,017
We must find him immediately, Opal!

128
00:09:40,061 --> 00:09:44,020
Where are you, Sapphire?
Answer if you hear me! Sapphire!

129
00:09:58,701 --> 00:10:01,454
Oh, what a magnificent castle!

130
00:10:01,501 --> 00:10:05,210
It is truly huge! Make yourself more comfortable,
don't get too worked up.

131
00:10:09,301 --> 00:10:11,019
I have an idea!

132
00:10:11,301 --> 00:10:14,020
Now it all depends on you, Opal!
I'm counting on you!

133
00:10:14,141 --> 00:10:17,690
Prince Sapphire is entering
the castle!

134
00:10:17,741 --> 00:10:19,572
I want to see
Grand Duke Duralumin!

135
00:10:19,621 --> 00:10:21,498
The Grand Duke has gone hunting!

136
00:10:21,901 --> 00:10:24,017
- Then I will wait for him inside!
- You can't!

137
00:10:24,221 --> 00:10:27,179
What did you say?! - I was joking!
Please, forgive me!

138
00:10:27,221 --> 00:10:29,416
Let's go to the apartments
of the Grand Duke!

139
00:10:29,981 --> 00:10:33,530
What a beautiful house!
Some have too much and some have nothing, eh!

140
00:10:33,581 --> 00:10:35,617
Prince Sapphire is here, Grand Duke

141
00:10:36,221 --> 00:10:38,098
He is bringing along
some strange people.

142
00:10:38,141 --> 00:10:40,336
Isn't it a stroke of luck
that he came to you?

143
00:10:40,701 --> 00:10:43,579
- I think I understand.
- You could kill him now,

144
00:10:43,621 --> 00:10:45,737
without anyone knowing.

145
00:10:46,381 --> 00:10:48,849
I will not allow
Sapphire to be killed!

146
00:10:48,901 --> 00:10:50,619
That bust is speaking!

147
00:10:51,781 --> 00:10:54,500
Sapphire is mine!
No one must touch him!

148
00:10:54,541 --> 00:10:56,259
Show yourself! Who are you?

149
00:11:02,941 --> 00:11:05,171
You don't scare us,
whoever you are!

150
00:11:05,221 --> 00:11:08,816
I am Mephisto!
And you will do as I say.

151
00:11:08,861 --> 00:11:11,455
Excuse me, Mephisto, why does Sapphire
interest you so much?

152
00:11:11,661 --> 00:11:15,017
I must transplant the heart
of Sapphire into my daughter's chest,

153
00:11:15,061 --> 00:11:17,529
that way I will succeed in
making her a great witch!

154
00:11:17,581 --> 00:11:19,811
Doing something like
that is truly impossible!

155
00:11:20,741 --> 00:11:24,336
I am Mephisto! For me,
everything is possible!

156
00:11:24,381 --> 00:11:26,815
Look! Turn into flowers!

157
00:11:28,701 --> 00:11:30,737
But this is a cheap trick!

158
00:11:30,781 --> 00:11:33,011
Insolent! "Cheap", you said?

159
00:11:33,061 --> 00:11:35,131
Then I'll show you!

160
00:11:35,461 --> 00:11:38,737
- Do you like an electric cape?
- Ouch, that hurts!

161
00:11:40,701 --> 00:11:42,612
And if you're not convinced...

162
00:11:43,141 --> 00:11:45,894
Hail Mephisto!

163
00:11:53,781 --> 00:11:56,170
Are you convinced,
now, of my power?

164
00:11:56,221 --> 00:11:58,177
Yes, Mephisto! But what
will happen to Sapphire...

165
00:11:58,221 --> 00:12:00,496
...when will you succeed in taking
his boy's heart?

166
00:12:00,541 --> 00:12:02,691
She will only become
an ordinary girl

167
00:12:02,741 --> 00:12:04,618
But that is what we want too!

168
00:12:04,661 --> 00:12:06,379
Listen, Grand Duke,
Mephisto can be of use to you.

169
00:12:06,421 --> 00:12:09,174
If he makes the Prince
a girl, the throne will be yours.

170
00:12:09,221 --> 00:12:13,055
Lord of darkness, I pay
homage to you! I have decided to help you.

171
00:12:13,221 --> 00:12:15,655
That's fine!
Then bring Sapphire here to me!

172
00:12:15,701 --> 00:12:17,214
I'm running to call him!

173
00:12:17,261 --> 00:12:20,173
Grand Duke, I know you are at the castle!
Show yourself! I must speak with you!

174
00:12:20,221 --> 00:12:23,770
Prince, please come in! We have
prepared a worthy welcome for you!

175
00:12:23,821 --> 00:12:25,732
I am only here to ask
the Grand Duke...

176
00:12:25,781 --> 00:12:28,056
...why he had the house
of these men destroyed!

177
00:12:28,101 --> 00:12:31,491
Don't worry, I just wanted
to compensate them for the damage suffered.

178
00:12:31,541 --> 00:12:33,771
Here! These provisions are for you!

179
00:12:33,821 --> 00:12:37,131
- And now scram!
- Thank you, sir! We are grateful to you!

180
00:12:37,261 --> 00:12:40,173
This way, please.
The Grand Duke is waiting for you.

181
00:12:44,101 --> 00:12:46,774
Where is the Grand Duke? I don't see him here.

182
00:12:47,341 --> 00:12:50,014
- Sapphire! It's me: Tink!
- Stop!

183
00:12:50,061 --> 00:12:53,098
You cannot enter the castle of
the Grand Duke without permission!

184
00:12:53,141 --> 00:12:55,132
This will be the end of the Prince.

185
00:12:55,221 --> 00:12:58,054
Come, Grand Duke, show
yourself! I would like to speak to you!

186
00:13:01,421 --> 00:13:03,252
Damned monster!

187
00:13:06,701 --> 00:13:08,373
I will annihilate you!

188
00:13:13,821 --> 00:13:15,891
I understand: you are Mephisto!

189
00:13:17,341 --> 00:13:20,811
Well, little Prince! I am
truly glad to meet you!

190
00:13:20,861 --> 00:13:23,534
For a long time I have been
waiting for this day to arrive!

191
00:13:24,021 --> 00:13:26,012
What do you want from me?

192
00:13:26,061 --> 00:13:29,178
Your heart, so fearless that
it does not fear the devil!

193
00:13:29,221 --> 00:13:31,610
If you really want it,
you'll have to conquer it!

194
00:13:31,661 --> 00:13:34,573
- Just you and me, Mephisto!
- Go, Mephisto!

195
00:13:35,541 --> 00:13:37,691
- Damnation!
- Go, Mephisto!

196
00:13:37,741 --> 00:13:41,620
- May he fall into my power!
- I feel paralyzed!

197
00:13:41,741 --> 00:13:44,016
I can no longer feel my muscles!

198
00:13:44,061 --> 00:13:48,020
Now you are in my hands and nothing
more will stop me from taking your heart!

199
00:13:50,461 --> 00:13:53,897
Diabolical hands,
emanate your infernal fluid...

200
00:13:53,941 --> 00:13:56,535
..that envelops every
mortal in a shroud of sleep!

201
00:13:56,581 --> 00:13:58,776
We did well
to ally with the devil!

202
00:14:01,221 --> 00:14:04,293
And who could that be? You
go and see who it is, Baron!

203
00:14:07,301 --> 00:14:08,939
Sapphire!

204
00:14:08,981 --> 00:14:13,020
Sapphire! Sapphire! Wake
up! Don't go near him!

205
00:14:13,061 --> 00:14:16,019
How dare you?! I..
Ah, I'm paralyzed!

206
00:14:16,061 --> 00:14:18,529
- Mephisto!
- Break the spell!

207
00:14:18,581 --> 00:14:22,415
Now I recognize you: you are
an angel! I will have my revenge!

208
00:14:23,501 --> 00:14:26,618
Wait! Fall down the stairs!
Wait! Wait!

209
00:14:32,901 --> 00:14:34,892
Damn it,
we almost made it!

210
00:14:34,941 --> 00:14:37,136
Mephisto, you have really
disappointed me! Really!

211
00:14:37,341 --> 00:14:40,811
- You were saying?
- You let yourself be fooled like a novice!

212
00:14:41,021 --> 00:14:43,660
I couldn't do anything!
That child is an angel!

213
00:14:43,701 --> 00:14:45,339
An angel?!

214
00:14:45,381 --> 00:14:47,690
An angel
is a difficult opponent.

215
00:14:47,741 --> 00:14:49,379
- Nylon!
- Yes, Grand Duke?

216
00:14:49,421 --> 00:14:51,651
- Get that nose out of my face!
- Is this okay, Grand Duke?

217
00:14:51,701 --> 00:14:54,499
- We must kill that boy.
- Yes, sir!

218
00:14:54,541 --> 00:14:59,695
Sapphire, wake up! He's still
unconscious! I must look for some water.

219
00:14:59,741 --> 00:15:02,255
I'll splash it on his face, like this...

220
00:15:06,941 --> 00:15:08,932
Ah, my nose! My nose!

221
00:15:13,901 --> 00:15:17,814
- I captured him, Grand Duke!
- The boy has left you in quite a bad way.

222
00:15:18,901 --> 00:15:22,371
Don't come near me!
Take him away! He'll disintegrate us!

223
00:15:22,421 --> 00:15:26,414
- Yes! yes! yes!
- You can continue your work.

224
00:15:27,341 --> 00:15:30,890
Hail Mephisto! Infernal forces!

225
00:15:30,941 --> 00:15:34,013
Emanate from my hands
and envelop the Prince!

226
00:15:34,101 --> 00:15:37,013
May he be lifted into the air!

227
00:15:38,781 --> 00:15:42,137
May he be brought to my lair!

228
00:15:44,541 --> 00:15:47,499
- Thank you for your help!
- You're welcome, Mephisto.

229
00:15:47,621 --> 00:15:50,613
Hail Mephisto!

230
00:15:52,061 --> 00:15:54,450
Now the throne will be mine!

231
00:15:59,621 --> 00:16:03,500
You will stay up there until
the eagles devour you!

232
00:16:03,701 --> 00:16:05,612
Long live the Baron!

233
00:16:09,581 --> 00:16:12,812
I can't manage to free myself!
The knots are too tight!

234
00:16:12,861 --> 00:16:14,931
I'm very worried about Sapphire!

235
00:16:18,741 --> 00:16:22,734
I am not your breakfast! If you want
to scare me, you've succeeded!

236
00:16:22,781 --> 00:16:25,659
Now go away, otherwise..
more will come!

237
00:16:36,781 --> 00:16:40,694
Dark forces of evil,
of the underworld and of darkness,

238
00:16:40,741 --> 00:16:44,177
rise from the eternal fire
and from the cold of the graves!

239
00:16:44,421 --> 00:16:47,857
I, Mephisto, your master,
call you!

240
00:16:47,901 --> 00:16:50,620
Hail Mephisto!

241
00:16:52,421 --> 00:16:56,619
Enter! Come into the crucible
of my black magic alchemy!

242
00:16:57,101 --> 00:17:01,253
Hecate! Lie down on the table!

243
00:17:01,541 --> 00:17:03,691
You are about to become
a great witch!

244
00:17:03,741 --> 00:17:07,780
I will give you the heart and the courage
of this girl, soon!

245
00:17:08,701 --> 00:17:12,580
This magic potion
will release the energy of evil within you!

246
00:17:18,101 --> 00:17:21,013
Rise, tree of wickedness!

247
00:17:21,061 --> 00:17:23,859
Help me execute my work!
I command you!

248
00:17:26,221 --> 00:17:30,294
The moment has come! My
masterpiece will be completed!

249
00:17:30,581 --> 00:17:33,300
Help! Help! Will you stop it?

250
00:17:33,901 --> 00:17:37,177
I won't make it! Go away!

251
00:17:39,021 --> 00:17:40,500
Help!

252
00:17:41,181 --> 00:17:43,172
Help! Help!

253
00:17:44,181 --> 00:17:46,979
Look! There's a shoe
fallen from the sky!

254
00:17:47,301 --> 00:17:49,610
What happened? Let's go see!

255
00:17:49,661 --> 00:17:53,449
What do I see! Brothers, over
there is a child hanging from a tree!

256
00:17:55,101 --> 00:17:58,013
- What do we do?
- We must help him!

257
00:17:58,061 --> 00:18:01,815
- Before they devour him!
- Quick, brothers, let's run!

258
00:18:01,861 --> 00:18:04,250
Don't start cutting from
where I'm cutting, eh!

259
00:18:04,301 --> 00:18:06,690
Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on!

260
00:18:06,741 --> 00:18:09,209
Idiot! This is the tree!

261
00:18:10,541 --> 00:18:12,293
They are helping me!

262
00:18:15,021 --> 00:18:17,410
Let's get out from under the tree!

263
00:18:30,021 --> 00:18:31,898
Yes, that's fine!

264
00:18:38,181 --> 00:18:41,651
Look, a ravine!
We won't make it across!

265
00:18:41,701 --> 00:18:44,215
If we cut down that tree,
it can serve us as a bridge!

266
00:18:44,301 --> 00:18:47,179
Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on!

267
00:18:51,381 --> 00:18:53,417
Now you can cross
the ravine.

268
00:18:53,461 --> 00:18:56,339
- And aren't you coming? - The ravine
marks the border of the land.

269
00:18:56,381 --> 00:18:59,020
- We are forbidden to go beyond.
- Then goodbye, friends!

270
00:18:59,061 --> 00:19:00,619
Goodbye!

271
00:19:18,021 --> 00:19:19,818
Come,

272
00:19:21,821 --> 00:19:24,415
infernal and occult forces!

273
00:19:31,341 --> 00:19:33,650
Guide me, demon brothers!

274
00:19:37,581 --> 00:19:41,620
Hold my hand tight!
Now I will take her heart!

275
00:19:43,261 --> 00:19:45,172
Sapphire!

276
00:19:45,221 --> 00:19:49,533
What?! Tree of evil, stop
that angel from approaching!

277
00:19:51,021 --> 00:19:53,012
You won't make it through!

278
00:19:53,261 --> 00:19:55,013
That's what you think!

279
00:19:55,541 --> 00:19:58,009
You must suffocate him!

280
00:20:01,021 --> 00:20:04,013
- Take this!
- What do you think you're doing?!

281
00:20:08,901 --> 00:20:12,530
Damn it!
I'll get you, damned feather!

282
00:20:13,101 --> 00:20:16,093
Help! My eye!
The formula, Hecate!

283
00:20:16,141 --> 00:20:18,371
Hail Mephisto! Disappear, feather!

284
00:20:23,501 --> 00:20:27,016
The tree of evil will die!
Don't dare to come near!

285
00:20:27,421 --> 00:20:30,697
See what you've done,
Hecate? Stop that angel!

286
00:20:32,741 --> 00:20:34,697
I'm taking the girl away!

287
00:20:35,261 --> 00:20:37,331
Hail Mephisto!

288
00:20:45,261 --> 00:20:47,172
Infernal frog!

289
00:20:47,861 --> 00:20:49,817
Hey! What is that?

290
00:20:54,021 --> 00:20:56,137
Infernal tarantula!

291
00:21:01,341 --> 00:21:03,855
It wants to catch me with that thread!

292
00:21:14,101 --> 00:21:17,332
It's useless for you to hide,
Mephisto! I know you're not far!

293
00:21:19,461 --> 00:21:21,019
They are cannons!

294
00:21:24,421 --> 00:21:26,412
I destroyed it!

295
00:21:28,421 --> 00:21:30,412
Sapphire, wake up!

296
00:21:33,421 --> 00:21:35,537
- Tink!
- Yes, Sapphire, it's me!

297
00:21:35,701 --> 00:21:37,259
Tell me, Tink, where am I?

298
00:21:37,301 --> 00:21:41,135
You're in Mephisto's lair! Look!
Hail Mephisto!

299
00:21:42,701 --> 00:21:45,374
Mephisto! This time
you won't defeat me! Wait for me

300
00:21:45,421 --> 00:21:47,139
Sapphire!

301
00:21:50,901 --> 00:21:53,699
Here is another monster!

302
00:21:54,901 --> 00:21:59,417
Rise, immense monster!
And devour Sapphire!

303
00:22:07,061 --> 00:22:09,370
- Stop!
- It's terrifying!

304
00:22:10,021 --> 00:22:11,613
It's getting closer!

305
00:22:12,021 --> 00:22:14,012
Now it's moving the mountain!

306
00:22:18,901 --> 00:22:22,496
Take this and drink it!
I hope you like it!

307
00:22:32,821 --> 00:22:34,857
I order you to devour them!

308
00:22:36,141 --> 00:22:38,018
Take this!

309
00:22:40,861 --> 00:22:45,491
So you want a fight to the
death! Mountain, sink!

310
00:22:47,501 --> 00:22:49,219
What's happening?

311
00:22:55,421 --> 00:22:57,412
Help!

312
00:23:00,821 --> 00:23:03,016
What's happening? It's all vanished!

313
00:23:07,341 --> 00:23:09,536
- Sapphire!
- I don't understand.

314
00:23:09,581 --> 00:23:12,175
I don't understand
what happened either!

315
00:23:12,221 --> 00:23:14,257
Someone must have helped you!

316
00:23:14,301 --> 00:23:17,691
Maybe it was Hecate!
Hecate, come here immediately!

317
00:23:18,901 --> 00:23:21,051
Was it you who helped
the Princess?

318
00:23:21,101 --> 00:23:23,410
Dad, I'm sorry to confess it,
but it was me.

319
00:23:23,461 --> 00:23:26,100
But my daughter, it is for you
that I did all this!

320
00:23:26,141 --> 00:23:29,690
I wanted it for your own good, to
make you become an excellent witch!

321
00:23:29,741 --> 00:23:32,574
Instead, you helped Sapphire!
Why did you do it?

322
00:23:32,621 --> 00:23:36,534
Because I don't want to become
a witch when I grow up.

323
00:23:36,581 --> 00:23:39,891
Little degenerate, unnatural and
unworthy daughter of your father!

324
00:23:39,941 --> 00:23:43,695
But I won't give up! One day, I
will succeed in taking your heart...

325
00:23:43,741 --> 00:23:47,097
...to give it to my daughter
Hecate! Remember that!

326
00:23:50,661 --> 00:23:52,891
That little girl will
never become a witch.

327
00:23:52,941 --> 00:23:56,013
- She's too good!
- Yes, she really is good.

328
